WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:02.780
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:08.720
Today I am going to explain an action-comedy
film called “The Shaolin Boy.”

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.130
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:16.090
Watch out and take care!

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:19.949
Lee is a six-year-old monk studying in the
Shaolin Monastery.

00:00:19.949 --> 00:00:23.520
He has lived in the monastery and trained
in martial arts his entire life.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.630
At the beginning of the movie, Lee walks into
the monastery and apologizes to his seniors

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.339
for what he is about to do.

00:00:30.339 --> 00:00:33.320
He has to showcase his skills by fighting
them.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:36.410
Without him releasing, a monk attacks him
from the side.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:40.300
Lee immediately dodges, even though the attack
took him by surprise.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:44.930
The monk manages to throw Lee to the wall
but he bounces right back and continues to

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:45.930
fight.

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:49.920
He showers the monk with several kicks midair,
displaying his skills.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:54.990
Moments later, the first monk is defeated
when Lee restrains him with a woven bamboo

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.270
basket.

00:00:56.270 --> 00:01:01.420
Following that, he is attacked by the second
monk armed with swords. Lee manages to disarm

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:05.640
his opponent, leaving him with no choice but
to accept defeat.

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:08.750
Then, he approaches the third and last monk.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:13.640
Even when meditating, the monk senses Lee
coming towards him and uses a prayer bead

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:17.380
to perfectly hit the mirror in a way that
blinds Lee.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:22.040
Then, in less than a second, the kid is picked
up and thrown to the ground.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:28.240
The monk is about to win with the last blow
but Lee slides away and kicks him in the chest.

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:31.409
The two battle and in the end, Lee wins again.

00:01:31.409 --> 00:01:37.620
He bows to the shrine and walks outside while
his opponents bow to him as a sign of respect.

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:42.060
The head monk tells Lee that he scored eighty-eight
out of a hundred in the test, which is better

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.960
than most students his age.

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:47.840
Lee is about to go to a new school in the
city as an exchange student.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:52.510
During his stay there, he is supposed to live
with a family of three, fathered by a great

00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:55.490
scientist who is close to the head monk.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:02:00.240
After wishing farewell, the kid leaves for
the city, excited to meet new people.

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:04.560
In the following scene, we are introduced
to fifteen-year-old Feng, the chief of the

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:06.590
taekwondo club in his school.

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:11.620
He has a fourth-grader sister Shanshan, who
always cheers for her older brother and loves

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:12.750
him dearly.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:15.810
The manager of the school Taekwondo club is
Lan.

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:20.310
She analyses Feng’s matches and gives him
a summary of what he could have done better.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:24.090
Lan also seems to have a crush on him but
denies it when asked.

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:29.150
Lan’s brother Yu is a glutton who loves
to eat more than anything in the world.

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:32.980
The four of them live in the same neighborhood
and are pretty close to each other.

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:38.120
One afternoon, Lan is analyzing the previous
day’s Taekwondo match as always while her

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:40.940
brother Yu binges on chips and snacks.

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:44.540
The sibling’s father is a scientist named
Dr. Han.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:49.750
Their mother died a few years ago after which,
Dr. Han has indulged himself in his work.

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:53.870
He is working on a special device that a group
of gangsters is interested in.

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:57.700
Dr. Han calls the kids to ask them how they
are doing.

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:00.590
Lan is annoyed because her father is never
home with them.

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:06.319
Dr. Han promises to return back as soon as
possible and tells them to open a gift box

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:08.530
that he has just sent to the house.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:13.540
In reality, the box contains the special device
he has created that the gang is after.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:17.720
As they are talking, Lee knocks on their door
and is received by Lan.

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:22.120
She gets busy welcoming him and doesn’t
notice that her father is being abducted on

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:23.840
the other side of the video call.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:28.959
The leader of the gang, Larry, threatens Dr.
Han to hand them the important device.

00:03:28.959 --> 00:03:33.090
Dr. Han, on the other hand, claims that there
is no such device.

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:39.480
What he has been working on is an AI technology
that will allow his kids to talk to an AI

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:44.459
with their mother’s voice.

00:03:44.459 --> 00:03:47.520
The leader doesn’t believe him and holds
him hostage.

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:51.980
On checking the CCTV camera footage, he finds
out that the device has been shipped to his

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:54.110
home and received by his children.

00:03:54.110 --> 00:04:00.450
Two of Larry’s henchmen, Sloppy and Fist
volunteer to retrieve the device no matter

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:01.450
what.

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:04.670
Until they get hold of it, Dr. Han will be
kept hostage.

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:08.780
Sloppy and Fist are excited because this is
their first job as gangsters.

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:13.780
They dress up in eccentric clothes as a disguise
and arrive in front of Lan’s house.

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:18.489
Sloppy tries to barge in when it gets dark
but Fist suggests they wait until the kids

00:04:18.489 --> 00:04:20.680
leave for school the next day.

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:23.910
Meanwhile, Lee is getting accustomed to the
new environment.

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:29.020
He sees Lan watching a Taekwondo match on
TV and is fascinated by the sport.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:34.300
Later, he tries to do his daily night-time
meditation while Yu plays a video game.

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:37.930
Both of them disturb each other and find it
hard to live together.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:45.290
But soon, they play the video game together
and bond over it.

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:50.981
In her room, Lan opens that box sent by her
father and sees a panda keychain inside, what

00:04:50.981 --> 00:04:55.270
she doesn’t know is that it also holds a
pen drive that the gang is looking for.

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:59.830
On pressing a button, the panda asks Lan to
set a voice-activated password.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:04.730
She exclaims “what password” which is
set as the new password without her knowing.

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:10.450
On testing it further, she realizes that the
panda is an AI that has their mother’s voice.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:16.070
The next morning, Lee gets ready for his first
day of school, alongside Yu and Lan.

00:05:16.070 --> 00:05:20.860
Sloppy and Fist watch them from inside their
car, planning to break in right after they

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:22.280
are out of sight.

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:26.910
But just then, Sloppy notices that Lan has
hung the panda keychain in her bag.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:30.150
They change plans and decide to steal it from
her.

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:34.040
On the way to school, the group meets Feng
and his sister Shanshan.

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:35.680
Lan introduces him to Lee.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:40.500
As they're talking, Sloppy swiftly snatches
the keyring and walks away.

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:44.930
Lee notices this and does a high jump and
several backflips to get to him.

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.740
Feng is impressed to see that he is a skilled
fighter.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:52.330
They both beat him up and get the panda but
Sloppy doesn’t give up.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:56.360
He snatches it yet again, not learning his
lesson from the first time.

00:05:56.360 --> 00:06:00.960
The kids soon surround him and trap him inside
a garbage bin before pushing him down the

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.960
road.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:06.690
In the school, Lee is introduced to his classmates
who are amazed to see a child monk for the

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:07.820
first time.

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:12.310
They ask him questions like if he can ever
get married, and if he knows Kung Fu.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:16.720
The teacher quiets them down and asks them
to wait for the gym period to see his Kung

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:17.919
Fu skills.

00:06:17.919 --> 00:06:22.740
During the gym class, the coach informs them
of a fitness test that will be held next month.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:27.169
The ones who do not pass the test will have
to repeat the class next year as well.

00:06:27.169 --> 00:06:31.910
Yu is worried because he is out of shape and
can barely walk properly.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.639
Their first task is to run a hundred meters.

00:06:34.639 --> 00:06:39.420
A trained Lee completes two laps before his
classmates can complete even one.

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:44.270
Next, they are asked to do push-ups, one of
many specialties that Lee has.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:48.100
He does more than a hundred while the other
kids can hardly do two.

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:53.389
To show his true capabilities, he even does
pushups with a single hand and then with his

00:06:53.389 --> 00:06:58.860
body vertical.

00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:00.580
Everyone cheers and praises him.

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:03.199
Then, it is time for them to do high jumps.

00:07:03.199 --> 00:07:06.380
Elementary school high jumps are a piece of
cake for Lee.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:10.240
However, Yu struggles and falls face down
on the platform.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:15.100
Back in Dr. Han’s lab, the gangster Larry
has tied him to a chair and is hitting him

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:16.350
with golf balls.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:21.449
To keep himself entertained, Dr. Han teaches
him new techniques at his own expense.

00:07:21.449 --> 00:07:26.949
At night, Sloppy and Fist break into the house
looking for the panda. Lee sees them and hides

00:07:26.949 --> 00:07:29.270
behind a stuffed toy to scare them.

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:34.110
He troubles the rookie gangsters but they
soon see him and try to fight him.

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:38.950
When Lan comes downstairs, the gangsters grab
the panda and run away.

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:42.310
Lee tells them what happened but the siblings
think he is joking.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:46.610
In the following scene, Sloppy and Fist are
at the lab with golf balls in their mouths.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:50.949
It turns out that they accidentally stole
a panda humidifier instead of the special

00:07:50.949 --> 00:07:54.960
device.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:08:00.280
Larry has to sell the said device to his clients
in three days which makes him impatient.

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:05.310
He uses Fist and Sloppy as golf tees to threaten
them to complete the task quicker.

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:10.120
The following day after school, the group
is watching Feng fight against an opponent.

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:14.849
Yu and Shanshan are talking about two ugly
girls in the back of the bleacher.

00:08:14.849 --> 00:08:19.000
It turns out that the said girls are Sloppy
and Fist in disguise.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:23.639
They eye the panda on Lan’s bag and wait
for the right time to retrieve it.

00:08:23.639 --> 00:08:29.310
Just then, Lee challenges Feng to a match
and everyone goes to the front to watch it.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:34.209
Behind them, the thugs try to take off the
panda from the bag but their wig gets stuck,

00:08:34.209 --> 00:08:35.429
making them struggle.

00:08:35.429 --> 00:08:40.559
As the intense fight continues, we see that
Feng and Lee match in skills.

00:08:40.559 --> 00:08:44.540
It ends abruptly when both the participants
refuse to hit each other.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:49.779
Just then everyone turns around and sees Sloppy
and Fist in their school girl dresses.

00:08:49.779 --> 00:08:54.429
The kids attack the gangsters but the two
manage to flee with the panda after taking

00:08:54.429 --> 00:08:55.949
a girl hostage.

00:08:55.949 --> 00:09:00.369
The students go to the principal and call
the police who promise to do their best to

00:09:00.369 --> 00:09:01.369
find them.

00:09:01.369 --> 00:09:06.149
Lee blames himself for what happened because
if he hadn’t challenged Feng to a fight,

00:09:06.149 --> 00:09:07.970
Lan wouldn’t be distracted.

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:11.759
The rest of the group makes him understand
that they do not blame him.

00:09:11.759 --> 00:09:16.970
Larry finally gets the panda and uses the
pen drive inside it to open a program on a

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:17.970
computer.

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:20.610
However, it requires a password to be accessed.

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:24.579
Larry asks Dr. Han what the password is but
he refuses to tell them.

00:09:24.579 --> 00:09:29.731
A couple of programmers try to break the code
but even after trying for an entire day, they

00:09:29.731 --> 00:09:31.170
are not successful.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:35.519
By the end of it, Larry starts to lose his
mind and has a mental breakdown.

00:09:35.519 --> 00:09:41.439
Then, he sees Lan’s message on Dr. Han’s
phone and decides to use her to blackmail

00:09:41.439 --> 00:09:42.439
him.

00:09:42.439 --> 00:09:45.050
Lan has asked her father to come to her birthday
tomorrow.

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:50.569
Larry replies as Dr. Han and claims that he
will be there on time.

00:09:50.569 --> 00:09:54.730
The next evening, Lan and her friends gather
at her house for the birthday party.

00:09:54.730 --> 00:10:00.260
Meanwhile, Feng, Yu, Lee, and Shanshan have
gone to the market to get her presents.

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:03.399
Lan gets a message from her father saying
that he is outside.

00:10:03.399 --> 00:10:08.459
However, on going out to check, she is abducted
and put inside a van.

00:10:08.459 --> 00:10:12.889
At the same time, Lee and the group spot her
and follow the van on their bicycles.

00:10:12.889 --> 00:10:16.579
They reach Dr. Han’s lab and start looking
for her.

00:10:16.579 --> 00:10:20.990
Larry and his business partner are under stress
because they were supposed to close the deal

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:22.069
yesterday.

00:10:22.069 --> 00:10:27.240
To make the process quicker, Larry puts a
knife to Lan’s face and asks her about the

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:28.240
password.

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:33.059
She in turn inquires “what password” and
it opens the program on the computer.

00:10:33.059 --> 00:10:35.879
Outside, Sloppy and Fist are guarding the
place.

00:10:35.879 --> 00:10:39.410
Lee and Feng attack them and knock them out
in no time.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:44.110
However, they are soon confronted by Larry’s
right-hand man Bradley.

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:49.199
He is a fighter, hence, they struggle to defeat
him, even when teamed up.

00:10:49.199 --> 00:10:54.720
Inside the lab, Larry and his partner are
about to seal the deal but just then, Yu arrives

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:57.600
and secretly frees his sister and father.

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:01.189
Lee also comes to their aid and helps them
fight the gangsters.

00:11:01.189 --> 00:11:06.600
Amidst the chaos, Larry gets a hold of the
suitcase with the pen drive and runs outside.

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:11.439
He is stopped by Dr. Han, Yu, and Lan who
beat him up.

00:11:11.439 --> 00:11:15.759
In the meantime, Lee joins Feng again to fight
against Bradley.

00:11:15.759 --> 00:11:20.059
Initially, they struggle but they eventually
manage to defeat him.

00:11:20.059 --> 00:11:23.899
At last, the police arrive at the scene and
save the day.

00:11:23.899 --> 00:11:29.819
In the ending scene, we see the school’s
principal award Lee and Yu for their bravery.

00:11:29.819 --> 00:11:34.310
